fcitx5-boshiamy (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of standalone fcitx5-boshiamy engine with Speed Mode
    (,,sp), dynamic homophone lookup (` prefix), Simplified/Traditional
    output switching (,,c / ,,t), wildcard lookup (? and *), V/R/S/F
    selection, custom dictionary hot reload (,,r), reverse code lookup
    (,,q), and typing statistics (,,st).

